          "author": "Dougie Poynter and Tom Fletcher",
          "description": "This rip-ROARing romp of a Christmas story is read by the story’s authors, and features a host of festive sound effects, a read along version, and a whole lot of POO!! Danny wants everything for Christmas. But what he gets is a dinosaur, a very hungry dinosaur. Danny’s new dinosaur eats up all of Christmas, but as we all know, what goes in must come out… Danny is about to have the most EXPLOSIVE Christmas of his life! There's poop, presents and prehistoric creatures in this festive feast!",
